OL,3,GNEWSAHomes evacuated after explosives
OL,4,Afound in house
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 83-year-old man who was ordered from
OL,7,Fhis home after the bomb squad found
OL,8,Fammunition and explosives at a nearby
OL,9,Fhouse has said he did not even have
OL,10,Ftime to pack his bags.
OL,12,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) said
OL,13,Fofficers had been called to an
OL,14,F"unrelated investigation" in Shelley
OL,15,FGrove, Droylsden, on Wednesday
OL,16,Fafternoon when the discovery was made,
OL,17,Fleading to the evacuation.
OL,19,FA cordon was put in place while an
OL,20,Fexplosive ordnance disposal unit worked
OL,21,Fto make the area safe.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
