OL,3,GNEWSAHomes evacuated after explosives
OL,4,Afound in house
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers arrested a man in his 20s on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of criminal damage, arson and
OL,8,Fpossession of ammunition. A man in his
OL,9,F70s and a woman in her 60s were held on
OL,10,Fsuspicion of unlawfully possessing
OL,11,Fammunition and explosive substances.
